# Line-ending policy for this repository.
#
# This overrides the core.autocrlf setting of whoever clones it, so committed
# content is identical no matter who runs the publish, or on which OS
# (Windows, WSL, Linux, Windows-on-ARM). Text is normalised to LF in the
# repository; working trees follow each platform's convention.
#
# Byte-exact provenance for a publication run lives in the build zip archived
# to object storage, not here - see the ig-build-zips note in .gitignore.

* text=auto

# Binaries: never convert. This covers every binary extension present in the
# tracked tree, so the content heuristic is never relied on.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.gif   binary
*.bmp   binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.zip   binary
*.tgz   binary
*.pack  binary
*.db    binary
*.bin   binary
*.eot   binary
*.otf   binary
*.ttf   binary
*.woff  binary

# SVG is XML - declare it explicitly so it is diffed as text.
*.svg   text
